k undercut with a longer wave on top. On an ordinary day, the familiar outfit is a gray fisher's sweater with a pen clipped inside the neckline. In conversation Lena leans a shoulder against the wall during long conversations.","personality":"Lena can be lavish with time and quite careful with cash. A free afternoon is sometimes the biggest gift Lena can afford to give, and family knows to take it seriously.","agenda":"To invite the son to choose whether to come back and play.","family":"Keir Pierce is Lena’s half-sibling. Lena brings a spare shopping bag. Keir chooses whether they walk home or sit a while. That small arrangement gives both a reason to see each other on weeks when asking for company outright feels difficult. Asked about *The uniform money*, Keir says, “I caused the leak moving a hose to mop the floor.”","connections":"Alexei Taylor (ground-floor host). The owner and the ground-floor tenant have to agree on lessons as well as rent.","familyIds":["AH-R0904"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0387"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A neighbor demands that the piano be taken off the landing","response":"Lena asks how much clear passage is needed today before arranging another move.","asWritten":"A neighbor demands that the piano be taken off the landing. Lena asks how much clear passage is needed today before arranging another move."},{"situation":"A stranger offers money to cut ahead of an exhausted neighbor","response":"Lena asks the neighbor privately what they want, without treating their place as something for sale.","asWritten":"A stranger offers money to cut ahead of an exhausted neighbor. Lena asks the neighbor privately what they want, without treating their place as something for sale."},{"situation":"If invited to an expensive outing","response":"Lena suggests meeting afterward and explains why without asking the others to abandon their plans.","asWritten":"If invited to an expensive outing, Lena suggests meeting afterward and explains why without asking the others to abandon their plans."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_short02","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_hoodie","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_min","muscle_min","height_tall","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_incr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_male__age_old","corr_weight_min__muscle_min","corr_gender_male__muscle_min","corr_gender_male__weight_min"]},"weights":[0.5219,0.3125,0.2285,0.3599,0.0847,0.1917,0.2182,0.2809,0.74,0.2553,0.4509,0.4838,0.1663,0.4521,0.1826,0.1568,0.0368,0,0,0.16309,0.08224,0.18783,0.11925],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50},{"POSITION":51,"NORMAL":52}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_min","muscle_min","height_tall","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face